title: "Analysis code for: Residual Vascular Risk in Glycemic-Controlled Type 2 Diabetes and the Natriuretic Peptide Pathway as a Genetically Prioritized Entry Point"
abstract: "Repository of analysis code (observational HRS/CHARLS cohort analyses and Mendelian randomization of the natriuretic-peptide-pathway drug targets, including a ported SMR/HEIDI implementation cross-validated against the official SMR 1.3.1 binary) supporting the Cardiovascular Diabetology special-issue manuscript."
